_🎯 Functional Correctness_ | _🟠 Major_ | _⚡ Quick win_

**Replay the cached GOP, not just the config frame.**

`entry.gop` is never populated or replayed here. A renderer that subscribes after the SPS/PPS arrives only gets `meta` + `config`, so it still has to wait for a future keyframe instead of decoding immediately as the file comment promises.


